#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Simulate a four-site Fermi-Hubbard chain {#example-simulate-a-four-site-fermi-hubbard-chain}"
msgstr "Contoh: Simulasikan rantai Fermi-Hubbard empat tapak {#example-simulate-a-four-site-fermi-hubbard-chain}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Consider a four-site one-dimensional Fermi-Hubbard chain with hopping amplitude $t_h=1$, no on-site interaction, and zero chemical potential. A single spin-up fermion begins at site 0 and evolves across the chain.\n"
msgstr "Pertimbangkan rantai Fermi-Hubbard satu dimensi empat tapak dengan amplitud lompatan $t_h=1$, tiada interaksi dalam tapak, dan keupayaan kimia sifar. Satu fermion spin-atas bermula pada tapak 0 dan berevolusi merentasi rantai.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This small problem keeps the focus on the Dynamics Simulator workflow:\n"
msgstr "Masalah kecil ini memastikan tumpuan kekal pada aliran kerja Dynamics Simulator:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
