msgstr "Plotkan dinamik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Define the problem {#1-define-the-problem}"
msgstr "1. Takrifkan masalah {#1-define-the-problem}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The observable list measures the spin-up occupation\n"
msgstr "Senarai observabel mengukur hunian spin-atas\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle n_{i\\uparrow} \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle n_{i\\uparrow} \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "at each site. The observables are returned in the same order in which they are supplied.\n"
msgstr "pada setiap tapak. Observabel dikembalikan mengikut susunan yang sama seperti ketika ia dibekalkan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Run the dynamics simulation {#2-run-the-dynamics-simulation}"
msgstr "2. Jalankan simulasi dinamik {#2-run-the-dynamics-simulation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Submit the problem through the Qiskit Function. The Qiskit Functions Catalog handles IBM Quantum authentication, so you don't pass separate Fire Opal or hardware-provider credentials to `sim_qf.run()`.\n"
msgstr "Hantar masalah melalui Qiskit Function. Qiskit Functions Catalog mengendalikan pengesahan IBM Quantum, jadi anda tidak perlu menghantar bukti kelayakan Fire Opal atau penyedia perkakasan yang berasingan kepada `sim_qf.run()`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The returned object is a Qiskit Function job. You can keep the job ID to retrieve or inspect the workload later.\n"
msgstr "Objek yang dikembalikan ialah kerja Qiskit Function. Anda boleh menyimpan ID kerja untuk mendapatkan semula atau memeriksa beban kerja kemudian.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Retrieve the result {#3-retrieve-the-result}"
msgstr "3. Dapatkan hasil {#3-retrieve-the-result}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Convert the observable expectation values to a NumPy array. Each row corresponds to one observable, and each column corresponds to a recorded simulation time, beginning at $t=0$. For this example, the four rows contain the spin-up occupations of sites 0 through 3.\n"
msgstr "Tukarkan nilai jangkaan observabel kepada tatasusunan NumPy. Setiap baris sepadan dengan satu observabel, dan setiap lajur sepadan dengan masa simulasi yang direkodkan, bermula pada $t=0$. Untuk contoh ini, empat baris mengandungi hunian spin-atas bagi tapak 0 hingga 3.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Visualize the dynamics {#4-visualize-the-dynamics}"
msgstr "4. Visualisasikan dinamik {#4-visualize-the-dynamics}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The initial state contains one spin-up fermion and no spin-down fermions. Its evolution therefore remains in the single-particle subspace, whose four basis states correspond to the fermion occupying sites 0, 1, 2, and 3.\n"
msgstr "Keadaan awal mengandungi satu fermion spin-atas dan tiada fermion spin-bawah. Evolusinya oleh itu kekal dalam subruang zarah tunggal, yang empat keadaan asasnya sepadan dengan fermion yang menduduki tapak 0, 1, 2 dan 3.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this subspace, the Hamiltonian connects neighboring sites with hopping amplitude $-t_h$. For the parameters used here,\n"
msgstr "Dalam subruang ini, Hamiltonian menghubungkan tapak berjiran dengan amplitud lompatan $-t_h$. Untuk parameter yang digunakan di sini,\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"H_{\\mathrm{1p}}\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"H_{\\mathrm{1p}}\n"
"=\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"-t_h\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\\n"
"1 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\\n"
"0 & 1 & 0 & 1 \\\\\n"
"0 & 0 & 1 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"-t_h\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\\n"
"1 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\\n"
"0 & 1 & 0 & 1 \\\\\n"
"0 & 0 & 1 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Diagonalize this matrix with NumPy and evolve the initial state at the same times that were returned by the Dynamics Simulator. The squared magnitude of each state amplitude gives the spin-up occupation of the corresponding site.\n"
msgstr "Pepenjangkan matriks ini dengan NumPy dan evolusikan keadaan awal pada masa yang sama seperti yang dikembalikan oleh Dynamics Simulator. Kuasa dua magnitud setiap amplitud keadaan memberikan penghunian spin-atas bagi tapak yang sepadan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This calculation gives exact Hamiltonian evolution. Differences between the hardware estimates and this reference can include the finite Trotter step, measurement statistics, and residual hardware errors.\n"
msgstr "Pengiraan ini memberikan evolusi Hamiltonian yang tepat. Perbezaan antara anggaran perkakasan dan rujukan ini boleh merangkumi langkah Trotter terhingga, statistik pengukuran dan ralat perkakasan baki.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plot one panel for each site. The solid curves show the exact reference at the recorded times, and the markers show the hardware estimates returned by the Dynamics Simulator.\n"
msgstr "Plotkan satu panel bagi setiap tapak. Lengkung pepejal menunjukkan rujukan tepat pada masa yang direkodkan, dan penanda menunjukkan anggaran perkakasan yang dikembalikan oleh Dynamics Simulator.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/q-ctrl-dynamics-simulator/extracted-outputs/61a7ad6e-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/q-ctrl-dynamics-simulator/extracted-outputs/61a7ad6e-0.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "At $t=0$, the exact spin-up occupation is 1 at site 0 and 0 at the other sites. As the system evolves, hopping spreads the particle's probability across the chain. The occupation of site 1 increases first, followed by increasing occupation at sites 2 and 3. For the parameters in this example, the final recorded time is $t=1.6$. The exact occupations of sites 0 through 3 are approximately 0.026, 0.370, 0.392, and 0.211, respectively.\n"
msgstr "Pada $t=0$, penghunian spin-atas yang tepat ialah 1 pada tapak 0 dan 0 pada tapak lain. Apabila sistem berevolusi, lompatan menyebarkan kebarangkalian zarah merentasi rantai. Penghunian tapak 1 meningkat dahulu, diikuti peningkatan penghunian pada tapak 2 dan 3. Untuk parameter dalam contoh ini, masa terakhir yang direkodkan ialah $t=1.6$. Penghunian tepat tapak 0 hingga 3 masing-masing adalah lebih kurang 0.026, 0.370, 0.392 dan 0.211.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The exact occupations satisfy the following equation at every time, reflecting conservation of particle number:\n"
msgstr "Penghunian tepat memenuhi persamaan berikut pada setiap masa, yang mencerminkan keabadian bilangan zarah:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{i=0}^{3}\\langle n_{i\\uparrow}(t)\\rangle=1\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{i=0}^{3}\\langle n_{i\\uparrow}(t)\\rangle=1\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Individual site occupations can rise and fall as the particle evolves through the finite chain.\n"
msgstr "Penghunian tapak individu boleh naik dan turun apabila zarah berevolusi melalui rantai terhingga.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fetch error messages {#fetch-error-messages}"
msgstr "Dapatkan mesej ralat {#fetch-error-messages}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the workload enters the `ERROR` state, call `job.result()` to retrieve the error message. You can also inspect the function logs, if they are available.\n"
msgstr "Jika beban kerja memasuki keadaan `ERROR`, panggil `job.result()` untuk mendapatkan mesej ralat. Anda juga boleh memeriksa log fungsi, jika tersedia.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Common input-validation issues include an unsupported model or simulation method, an initial-state string that is too long, mismatched observable terms and coefficients, or an observable that references a site outside the initial-state string.\n"
msgstr "Isu pengesahan input yang lazim termasuk model atau kaedah simulasi yang tidak disokong, rentetan keadaan awal yang terlalu panjang, sebutan dan pekali observable yang tidak sepadan, atau observable yang merujuk tapak di luar rentetan keadaan awal.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get support {#get-support}"
msgstr "Dapatkan sokongan {#get-support}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For questions about the Dynamics Simulator or Fire Opal behavior, see the [Q-CTRL documentation](https://docs.q-ctrl.com/) or [contact Q-CTRL](https://form.typeform.com/to/iuujEAEI).\n"
msgstr "Untuk soalan tentang Dynamics Simulator atau gelagat Fire Opal, lihat [dokumentasi Q-CTRL](https://docs.q-ctrl.com/) atau [hubungi Q-CTRL](https://form.typeform.com/to/iuujEAEI).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For Qiskit Functions authentication, job management, or IBM Quantum Platform access, see the [Qiskit Functions documentation](/guides/functions).\n"
msgstr "Untuk pengesahan Qiskit Functions, pengurusan job atau akses IBM Quantum Platform, lihat [dokumentasi Qiskit Functions](/guides/functions).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Review the [`simulate_dynamics` API reference](https://docs.q-ctrl.com/references/fire-opal/fireopal/fireopal.simulate_dynamics) for the underlying model, simulation, observable, output, and validation definitions.\n"
"- Try the [Spin and charge dynamics in the Fermi-Hubbard model](/tutorials/fermi-hubbard-spin-charge-dynamics) tutorial.\n"
"- Read the [Fire Opal dynamics simulator overview](https://docs.q-ctrl.com/fire-opal/execute/run-algorithms/fire-opal-dynamics-simulator) for more detail about Trotterization, hardware-aware mapping, and Fire Opal error suppression.\n"
"- Modify the model parameters, initial state, time step, step count, and observables to study a different one-dimensional Fermi-Hubbard dynamics problem.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"- Semak [rujukan API `simulate_dynamics`](https://docs.q-ctrl.com/references/fire-opal/fireopal/fireopal.simulate_dynamics) untuk takrifan model, simulasi, observable, output dan pengesahan yang mendasari.\n"
"- Cuba tutorial [Dinamik spin dan cas dalam model Fermi-Hubbard](/tutorials/fermi-hubbard-spin-charge-dynamics).\n"
"- Baca [gambaran keseluruhan simulator dinamik Fire Opal](https://docs.q-ctrl.com/fire-opal/execute/run-algorithms/fire-opal-dynamics-simulator) untuk butiran lanjut tentang Trotterization, pemetaan sedar perkakasan dan penindasan ralat Fire Opal.\n"
"- Ubah suai parameter model, keadaan awal, langkah masa, bilangan langkah dan observable untuk mengkaji masalah dinamik Fermi-Hubbard satu dimensi yang berbeza.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
